      "content": "Temperature test results for model PT9L under IEC60601-1 clause 11.1.1a (Excessive temperatures in ME EQUIPMENT). Test ambient: 21.5°C. All 12 thermocouple measurement points passed (P). Maximum calculated temperatures at 40°C reference ranged from 40.07°C (Test corner) to 41.46°C (Battery). All measured temperatures were well below their respective maximum allowable limits as defined in IEC60601-1 Tables 22, 23, or 24.",
